{title: To Our God}
{artist: Brian Johnson, Jeremy Riddle, Joel Taylor}
{key: C}

{comment: Intro}
[F]  [Am]  [C]  [F]  [Am]  [G]

{comment: Verse 1}
[Am]Up from [F]the ashes Your [C]love has brought us
Out of [G]the darkness [Am]into the light
[F]Lifting our sorrows
Bearing [C]our burdens [G]healing our hearts

{comment: Chorus}
[Am]To our God we lift up one voice
[F]To our God we lift up one song
[C]To our God we lift up one voice
[G]Singing Hallelujah

{comment: Verse 2}
[Am]Chains have [F]been broken eyes [C]have been opened
An [G]army of dry bones [Am]is starting rise
[F]Death is defeated
We are [C]victorious for [G]You are alive

[F]Hallelujah [G]Hallelujah (repeat)

{comment: Bridge}
We'll make His [Am]praise [F]glorious [C]glorious, [G]glorious
For His [Am]name is [F]glorious [C]glorious, [G]glorious
Make  His [Am]praise [F]glorious [C]glorious, [G]glorious
Shout His [Am]name is [F]glorious [C]glorious, [G]glorious
